docs {
  # Berita API
  
  CRUD endpoints untuk manajemen berita/artikel.
  
  ## Base URL
  `/api/berita`
  
  ## Endpoints Overview
  
  | Method | Endpoint | Auth | Role | Description |
  |--------|----------|------|------|-------------|
  | GET | / | ❌ | Public | List berita dengan pagination |
  | GET | /:id | ❌ | Public | Detail berita |
  | POST | / | ✅ | Admin | Buat berita baru |
  | PUT | /:id | ✅ | Admin | Update berita |
  | DELETE | /:id | ✅ | Admin | Hapus berita |
  
  ## Kategori Valid
  - `Pendanaan`
  - `Workshop`
  - `Panduan`
  - `Umum` (default)
}
